        <details>αVβ8 integrin bound to a Fab (C6D4) on a holey carbon grid (particles have minimal preferred orientations): 1644 unaligned uncorrected movies were recorded automatically using SerialEM on a K2 camera in super-resolution (dstep=2.5) mode on a Titan Krios microscope operated at 300 kV (Cs=2.7) equipped with an energy filter using a slit width of 20 eV. The 12 second movies contain 60 frames and the super resolution pixel size is 0.6725 Å/px. The total dose per movie is ~55 e/Å^2. The gain reference anda file containing coordinates for a single dead column.</details>
